<h3 id="special-notice">Google Maps API Key</h3>
<p>Follow <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/get-api-key" target="_blank">Google's Maps JavaScript API setup instructions</a> to enable the API, configure billing and create a key restricted to your website. Save the key in <b>Appearance &gt; Customize &gt; Contact Page &gt; Google maps API key</b>.</p>
<p>Set the map center and Google Map Locations in <b>Appearance &gt; Theme Options &gt; Contact page</b>. Enter each location's latitude and longitude, separated by a comma, in its <b>Link</b> field. Adjust map type, style and zoom in <b>Appearance &gt; Customize &gt; Contact Page</b>.</p>
